  "overview": "The Pinnacle of SuperBike Racing!\n\nBased on the Arcade Hit, with real-time, texture-mapped graphics.\n\n2-Player, split-screen racing\n\nRecreated from the legendary Isle of Man Trophy races in England.\n\n8 custom-built bikes with authentic TT bike sound.\n\nChoose from 3 SuperBikes.\n\n4 Detailed Tracks\n2 grueling tracks from the arcade, plus 2 reversed courses.\n\nReach hair-raising speeds in 2 different driving perspectives. Automatic or 6-speed manual transmission."
